# Build context guard: keep the image small and reproducible.
#
# Everything here is either generated (datasets, checkpoints, logs, caches) or
# too large to bake into an image. `data/` and `checkpoints/` are re-created at
# runtime -- mount them (or a whole volume at /workspace) on vast.ai.

# --- generated / large artefacts --------------------------------------------
data/
logs/
checkpoints/
test_out/
peaks/
pretrain/
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.out
speaker_map_genshin.json

# --- python caches ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- vcs / editors ----------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vscode/
*.swp

# --- docker files themselves are not needed inside the image ----------------
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
DOCKER.md
